  "worked_solution": "This system can be written as\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -7 \\\\ -3 & 6\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTo find the solution, we need to calculate the inverse of the coefficient matrix \n$A=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -7 \\\\ -3 & 6\\end{aligned}].$\nThis gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{-1} & =\\frac{1}{1\\cdot 6-(-7)\\cdot (-3)}[\\begin{aligned}6 & 7 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{15}[\\begin{aligned}6 & 7 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now represent the solution to this system, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={A}^{-1}b \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{15}[\\begin{aligned}6 & 7 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$",
